type: software
title: Vehicle Trajectory Planning and Tracking Control in MATLAB
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Yuwen
    affiliation: The University of Hong Kong
abstract: >
  MATLAB simulations of Hybrid A-star warm starts, H-OBCA-style node-constrained
  trajectory optimization and linear time-varying MPC tracking for obstacle
  avoidance and reverse parking, with saved numerical results and animations.
keywords:
  - MATLAB
  - trajectory optimization
  - automated parking
  - model predictive control
